{"type":"text","timestamp":1794535458973,"sessionID":"ses_e2d61a837fferT6vx7XBcnnvGb","part":{"id":"prt_1d2a5f6dc001nahKCc5r512kDV","sessionID":"ses_e2d61a837fferT6vx7XBcnnvGb","messageID":"msg_1d2a5e923001lC21Do0YzFlHx4","type":"text","text":"T019 complete.\n\n**File written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/semantic-prompt-embedding-degrade.vitest.ts` (new, 212 lines)\n\nThe test mocks the adapter (`getAdapter`), the active pointer (`getActiveEmbedder`) and the read-only database (`getDbReadOnly`), stubs `VITEST` to `false` per case via `vi.stubEnv` in `beforeEach`, and runs scoring through the real `scoreAdvisorPrompt` against a `sqlite`-source projection. Six rows, matching the plan's matrix (listed in the file header):\n\n1. warm answer inside the deadline, cosine `1.0000`\n2. cold answer at 300 ms, still inside the deadline, cosine `1.0000`\n3. absent server → `prompt_embedding_unreachable`\n4. missing model → `prompt_embedding_model_missing`\n5. answer that never arrives → returns under `PROMPT_EMBEDDING_DEADLINE_MS + 100` with `prompt_embedding_timeout`\n6. generic failure → `prompt_embedding_failed`, result deep-equals the no-embedder result\n\n**Verify** (`$ADV` → `npx vitest run tests/semantic-prompt-embedding-degrade.vitest.ts`)\n\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  6 passed (6)\n   Start at  03:04:07\n   Duration  1.54s (transform 238ms, setup 24ms, import 326ms, tests 1.07s, environment 0ms)\n```\n\n**Evidence checks**\n- Comment hygiene: `rg -n \"T0[0-9]{2}|REQ-0|specs/\"` over the new file exits 1 (no matches).\n- `git status --short` shows only the new test file as my addition. Other modified/untracked paths belong to other workers and were left untouched. `tasks.md` was not ticked.\n\n**Could not do / notes**\n- Initial run failed all six because I first wrote the test under `tests/` with `../../lib/...` specifiers. Corrected to `../lib/...` before the passing run. No source files were changed.","time":{"start":1794535454428,"end":1794535458973}}}
